# Removed the deprecated LevelDB read journal
ProblemFilters.exclude[Problem]("akka.persistence.query.journal.leveldb.*")

# Removed deprecated EventEnvelope constructor and apply without timestamp, kept for binary compatibility since 2.6.2
ProblemFilters.exclude[DirectMissingMethodProblem]("akka.persistence.query.EventEnvelope.this")
ProblemFilters.exclude[DirectMissingMethodProblem]("akka.persistence.query.EventEnvelope.apply")
ProblemFilters.exclude[MissingTypesProblem]("akka.persistence.query.EventEnvelope$")
ProblemFilters.exclude[DirectMissingMethodProblem]("akka.persistence.query.EventEnvelope.tupled")
ProblemFilters.exclude[DirectMissingMethodProblem]("akka.persistence.query.EventEnvelope.curried")
